      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمْرَةٌ مَسْقُوطَةٌ</span></b>  [<i>A fallen date</i>]: some say that
this means <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَاقِطَةٌ</span>: others, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذَاتُ سُقُوطٍ</span> [<i>having a
falling</i>]: it may be from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْقَطِهُ</span>; like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْمُومٌ</span>
from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَحَمَّهُ ٱللّٰهُ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ مَسْقُوطٌ فِى يَدِهِ</span>
(tropical:)  <i>He is repenting, and abject;</i> as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَاقِطٌ</span></b> 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَدِهِ</span> (TA.)

